    {
      "id": 31,
      "title": "Inspect the trace",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 48,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### One request, connected signals\n\n1. Send `GET /api/readings` and copy its `traceId`.\n2. Open **Request traces** and paste the ID into Tempo\u2019s trace-ID search.\n3. Expand HTTP \u2192 `lab.readings` \u2192 JDBC `Execute query`.\n4. Match the trace ID with a request log on the left.\n\nServer-side tracing is configured to add an `oracle-db` span beneath JDBC. Database server spans are not yet working on ARM.\n\n**Try an error:** send `X-Client-Id: invalid client` to the endpoint. HTTP 400 appears in the traffic and error panels; validation rejects the request before SQL executes."
      }
    }
